<title>USA: Barrett Resources Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Barrett Resources Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>					   1997			  1996</p>
<p> Revenues			   $76,552		     $42,307</p>
<p> Net income for the period	9,913			 3,456</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>   and common share equivalent   0.31			  0.14</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>   shares outstanding	    31,945			25,234</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the rise in earnings reflects a rise in natural gas and oil production and prices.</p>
